OL,3,GNEWSAParish councillor says erosion is
OL,4,Apanicking village
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living in a village say they
OL,7,Fhave been "panicked" after being told
OL,8,Ftheir homes may need to be demolished
OL,9,Fbecause of coastal erosion, a parish
OL,10,Fcouncillor has said.
OL,12,FStephen Pavey, the chairman of Corton
OL,13,FParish Council, said erosion in the
OL,14,Farea had posed a "big threat" to
OL,15,Fresidents after singer Justin Hawkins
OL,16,Fsaid it could soon consume his parents'
OL,17,Fhome.
OL,19,FPavey added that East Suffolk Council's
OL,20,Fdecision to send residents a letter
OL,21,Fsaying they may have to give up their
OL,22,Fhomes was "a bit over the top".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
