OL,3,GNEWSAParish councillor says erosion is
OL,4,Apanicking village
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority previously said it would
OL,7,Fnot be able to fund replacement sea
OL,8,Fdefences at Corton, which is near
OL,9,FLowestoft, after being quoted #26m for
OL,10,Fworks in 2022.
